---
<section class="pt-6 pb-10 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-28" aria-labelledby="h1">
  <div class="wrap grid gap-x-16 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:grid-rows-[auto_1fr] lg:[grid-template-areas:'copy_fig'_'act_fig'] max-lg:[grid-template-areas:'copy'_'fig'_'act']">
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 [grid-area:copy]">
      <h1 id="h1" class="display text-[2.625rem] sm:text-6xl lg:text-[5rem] !text-ink">Why I created Toza.</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 lg:mt-8 text-lg lg:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-[34rem] text-text">People who give important decisions considerable care still entrust much of their digital privacy to vendor defaults. I created Toza to give that part of your life the expert attention it deserves.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="[grid-area:fig] lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-8 flex items-center gap-4 lg:block">
      <div class="frame shrink-0 w-24 h-24 lg:w-full lg:h-auto lg:aspect-[4/5]">
        <img class="portrait" src="/assets/img/dr-tabansky-portrait-square-640.webp" width="640" height="640" alt="{{ t.ui.portraitAlt }}" fetchpriority="high">
      </div>
      <figcaption class="lg:mt-9">
        <p class="font-serif text-xl lg:text-2xl text-ink">{{ t.person.name }}</p>
        <p class="text-[0.9375rem] lg:text-base text-muted leading-snug">{{ t.person.tagline }}</p>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="[grid-area:act] lg:col-span-7 lg:self-start">
      {% include "cta-hero.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-paper-deep" aria-labelledby="note-h">
  <div class="wrap grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
    <h2 id="note-h" class="h2 lg:col-span-4">A personal note.</h2>
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:col-start-6 grid gap-5 font-serif text-xl lg:text-[1.5rem] leading-relaxed text-ink">
      <p>In two decades of cybersecurity work, I kept noticing a contradiction. People are discerning about their advisers, investments and personal choices, yet their phones, accounts and apps still run on defaults or arrangements someone made for them years ago.</p>
      <p>Those settings were not chosen around their private risks. Private information can become leverage over your money, reputation and decisions.</p>
      <p>I created Toza to bring my cybersecurity experience directly to private individuals: understand their circumstances, identify the risks and carry out protection fitted to their lives.</p>
      <p class="pt-3 border-t border-brass text-2xl italic max-w-fit pe-10">Dr. Lior Tabansky</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="one-h">
  <div class="wrap grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
    <h2 id="one-h" class="h2 lg:col-span-5">The same expert, from first look to final check.</h2>
    <p class="lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7 text-lg lg:text-xl leading-relaxed text-text">When you engage Toza, you work with me personally from understanding the situation to making and verifying the agreed changes. I apply my judgment to your private circumstances and personally carry out the agreed technical work.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-paper-deep" aria-labelledby="method-h">
  <div class="wrap grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
    <h2 id="method-h" class="h2 lg:col-span-5">Establish the risks. Build the protection around them.</h2>
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7">
      <p class="font-serif text-[1.375rem] lg:text-3xl leading-snug text-ink">{{ t.stages.method }}</p>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg lg:text-xl leading-relaxed text-text">I select and adapt the relevant measures to your threat model and the services you need to keep using. The result is protection fitted to your circumstances, with practical teaching so you can use it.</p>
      <p class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-x-8">
        <a class="link" href="{{ contact.profile.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ t.buttons.profile }} <span class="flip" aria-hidden="true">{{ t.ui.arrowExternal }}</span><span class="sr-only"> {{ t.ui.newTab }}</span></a>
        <a class="link" href="/en/how-it-works/">{{ t.stages.link }} <span class="flip" aria-hidden="true">{{ t.ui.arrow }}</span></a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

